#MCell 4.00
#GAME 1-D totalistic
#RULE R1,C0,M1,B1
#BOARD 256x128
#WRAP 0
#D Pascal's Triangle: one live cell, and Pascal's triangle taken mod 2 below it.
#D A cell is born where exactly one of its neighbours is live, and no cell survives.
#D The rule is MCell's own example of its 1-D totalistic family.
#L A
